## opencode

- The rules above are `~/.agents/CORE.md`; do not re-read it. Before file writes, multi-step tool work, delegation, or current-fact research, read `~/.agents/ROUTER.md`, then only the packs it selects in `~/.agents/instructions/`. If a file is missing, continue with this block and say so.
- Skills load through the skill tool from `~/.agents/skills/`. Use `verify-claims` before treating a report as fact or committing.
- Subagents in `~/.config/opencode/agents/`: `heavy-output-runner` (bulky read-only evidence), `step-runner` (one briefed step), `project-explorer` (project map), `claim-verifier` and `evidence-overseer` (verification). They inherit the calling model unless their file sets `model: provider/id`; route strong models to verification and small ones to sweeps there.
